00:21:46.580 --> 00:21:48.780
Some of you that listen to the podcast will know why.
听过我们播客的人可能知道原因。

488
00:21:48.780 --> 00:21:50.460
It's because I love Star Wars.
因为我热爱《星球大战》。

489
00:21:50.600 --> 00:21:53.320
We have discussed Star Wars in depth on the show.
我们在节目中深入讨论过《星球大战》。

490
00:21:53.320 --> 00:21:57.900
And Jenna does not know Star Wars, and it wounded me in a way I still am not over.
而珍娜根本不懂《星球大战》，这让我受了伤，至今还没缓过来。

491
00:21:58.120 --> 00:21:59.040
I'm sorry.
我很抱歉。

492
00:22:00.260 --> 00:22:00.740
Oh.
哦。

493
00:22:03.140 --> 00:22:06.980
Listen, I know people were mad when I didn't know what a Jedi was.
听着，我知道大家在我不知道什么是绝地武士时很生气。

494
00:22:07.100 --> 00:22:07.680
I know.
我知道。

495
00:22:07.840 --> 00:22:08.260
Well.
好吧。

496
00:22:08.260 --> 00:22:10.580
I was asking earnest questions.
我当时是在认真地提问。

497
00:22:11.060 --> 00:22:15.780
Well, we got a fan mail flurry about your lack of Jedi knowledge, and I'm going to share
好吧，我们收到了大量关于你缺乏绝地武士知识的粉丝来信，我打算分享

498
00:22:15.780 --> 00:22:16.260
some of it.
其中的一些。

499
00:22:16.320 --> 00:22:20.680
But first, I'm going to give a shout out to someone in the audience who made us adorable
但首先，我要向观众席中的某位朋友致谢，她为我们制作了可爱的

500
00:22:20.680 --> 00:22:22.180
mini baby Yodas.
迷你尤达宝宝。

501
00:22:22.560 --> 00:22:23.000
Yay!
耶！

502
00:22:23.300 --> 00:22:27.420
They are so cute.
它们太可爱了。

503
00:22:33.010 --> 00:22:34.290
They are so adorable.
它们真是太招人喜欢了。

504
00:22:34.630 --> 00:22:35.810
Mine hangs in my office.
我的挂在办公室里。

505
00:22:35.970 --> 00:22:37.070
I see it every day.
我每天都能看到它。

506
00:22:37.290 --> 00:22:38.390
Mine's on my bookshelf.
我的放在书架上。

507
00:22:38.570 --> 00:22:38.770
Same.
我也是。

508
00:22:38.970 --> 00:22:39.470
I love it.
我超喜欢它。

509
00:22:39.550 --> 00:22:42.750
I didn't want to put it on the tree because I didn't want the cats to mess with it.
我不想把它挂在树上，因为我不想让猫去捣乱。

510
00:22:43.050 --> 00:22:44.470
It lives in my office.
它就放在我的办公室里。

511
00:22:44.950 --> 00:22:50.390
And also, I want to read a few letters from folks who have my same passion for Star Wars
另外，我想读几封来信，写信的人和我一样对《星球大战》充满热情，

512
00:22:50.390 --> 00:22:51.750
that Jenna does not.
而珍娜却对此毫无兴趣。

513
00:22:53.710 --> 00:22:54.650
Here we go.
我们开始吧。

514
00:22:54.650 --> 00:22:56.890
So, this is from Brian S.
这封信来自布莱恩·S。

515
00:22:57.230 --> 00:22:58.250
Hi, office ladies.
嗨，办公室女士们。

516
00:22:58.510 --> 00:23:03.290
I'm in the middle of listening to Michael's last Dundies, and the discussion on the Jedis
我正在听迈克尔最后一届邓迪奖的那期节目，关于绝地的讨论

517
00:23:03.290 --> 00:23:06.310
is making me spill my coffee all over my computer.
让我把咖啡洒得电脑上到处都是。

518
00:23:06.850 --> 00:23:11.950
I think it was Sam's, quote, I'm so viscerally mad line that did it.
我想是萨姆那句“我真是气得要命”让我破防了。

519
00:23:12.070 --> 00:23:16.770
It reminded me of Jim and Andy discussing Battlestar Galactica with Dwight, listening behind them,
这让我想起了吉姆和安迪讨论《太空堡垒卡拉狄加》时，德怀特在后面偷听的情景，

520
00:23:16.930 --> 00:23:22.350
to the point where I almost thought Jenna was faking her lack of Jedi knowledge just to
以至于我差点以为珍娜是在装作不懂绝地，

521
00:23:22.350 --> 00:23:23.110
get a reaction.
只是为了博取反应。

522
00:23:23.670 --> 00:23:27.390
Sometimes these conversations are even better than the episode recaps.
有时候这些对话比剧集回顾还要精彩。

523
00:23:29.430 --> 00:23:30.810
She was not faking.
她没有装。

524
00:23:31.050 --> 00:23:33.210
Brian, she is very clueless about Jedis.
布莱恩，她对绝地确实一窍不通。

525
00:23:33.750 --> 00:23:34.530
Robert D.
罗伯特·D。

526
00:23:34.710 --> 00:23:36.930
wrote in and said, first of all, I love the show.
来信说，首先，我非常喜欢这个节目。

527
00:23:37.070 --> 00:23:38.630
I've listened to everyone so far.
到目前为止每一期我都听了。

528
00:23:38.930 --> 00:23:43.690
But secondly, while listening to the show, I had so many actual laugh out loud moments,
但其次，在听节目的时候，我真的有很多次忍不住大笑出声，

529
00:23:43.850 --> 00:23:46.150
mostly during the Star Wars Jedi discussion.
主要是在讨论《星球大战》绝地的时候。

530
00:23:46.570 --> 00:23:49.250
I actually spoke out loud in the car.
我当时在车里甚至直接说了出来。

531
00:23:49.510 --> 00:23:51.310
Angela, just stay calm.
安吉拉，冷静点。

532
00:23:52.130 --> 00:23:56.490
But I forgot there were other people in the studio with you, specifically Sam.
但我忘了录音室里还有别人，特别是萨姆。

533
00:23:56.690 --> 00:23:57.790
Sam, they call you out again.
萨姆，他们又提到你了。

534
00:23:57.990 --> 00:24:02.730
When he came on and said, I'm getting viscerally mad, I almost drove off the road.
当他加入并说“我真是气得要命”时，我差点把车开到路沟里去。

535
00:24:04.610 --> 00:24:09.850
Now, I'm very excited because we got a question from Lauren, who's in the audience today.
现在，我很兴奋，因为我们收到了今天在现场的观众劳伦的问题。

536
00:24:10.370 --> 00:24:11.630
Lauren from Fort Collins.
来自柯林斯堡的劳伦。

537
00:24:11.830 --> 00:24:12.590
Lauren, are you here?
劳伦，你在吗？

538
00:24:12.790 --> 00:24:13.030
Yay!
耶！

539
00:24:17.520 --> 00:24:25.060
Lauren wrote in and said, Angela, if you were a Jedi, what color would your lightsaber be and where would you be from?
劳伦写信问，安吉拉，如果你是绝地武士，你的光剑会是什么颜色，你来自哪里？

540
00:24:25.200 --> 00:24:26.160
Oh, Lauren.
噢，劳伦。

541
00:24:26.920 --> 00:24:27.900
Oh, Lauren.
噢，劳伦。

542
00:24:27.900 --> 00:24:33.840
Well, you know, some say that the color of your saber identifies you, right?
嗯，你知道，有人说光剑的颜色代表了你的身份，对吧？

543
00:24:33.980 --> 00:24:35.800
Like Darth Vader's was red.
比如达斯·维达的是红色的。

544
00:24:35.980 --> 00:24:37.780
Maybe he had some aggression, clearly.
也许他确实有些攻击性，显而易见。

545
00:24:38.180 --> 00:24:43.460
And most Jedis have blue lightsabers, which is supposed to represent righteousness.
大多数绝地武士的光剑是蓝色的，这代表着正义。

546
00:24:43.900 --> 00:24:46.720
But I love Rey's storyline so much.
但我非常喜欢蕾伊的故事线。

547
00:24:46.720 --> 00:24:50.260
And I love that her lightsaber at the end ends up being yellow.
而且我喜欢她最后的光剑变成了黄色。

548
00:24:50.320 --> 00:24:54.420
And I like to think it's like new dawn, new beginnings, right?
我喜欢把它看作是新的曙光，新的开始，对吧？

549
00:24:54.640 --> 00:24:55.660
See, I'm a geek.
看，我是个极客。

550
00:24:55.660 --> 00:24:57.480
I'm a total geek for Star Wars.
我绝对是个《星球大战》的死忠粉。

551
00:24:57.720 --> 00:24:59.840
So roundabout answer, Lauren.
劳伦，你的回答真是绕弯子。

552
00:24:59.980 --> 00:25:00.260
Yellow.
黄色。

553
00:25:00.480 --> 00:25:02.340
I would like a yellow lightsaber, please.
我想要一把黄色的光剑，拜托了。

554
00:25:02.720 --> 00:25:12.420
And then as far as location, you know, I'm kind of a sucker for old school, like Forest Moon of Endor, because I want to hang out with the Ewoks.
至于地点嘛，你知道，我有点偏爱老派风格，比如恩多星的森林卫星，因为我想和伊沃克人待在一起。

555
00:25:12.520 --> 00:25:14.100
I want to go up in the trees.
我想爬到树上去。

556
00:25:14.320 --> 00:25:15.760
I want to see their village.
我想看看他们的村庄。

557
00:25:16.040 --> 00:25:21.180
And I know, listen, I know on Kashyyyk there's like a tree village thing, too.
我知道，听着，我知道卡西克星上也有那种树屋村。

558
00:25:21.320 --> 00:25:22.920
But I got to go with the Ewoks.
但我还是得选伊沃克人。

559
00:25:23.800 --> 00:25:26.000
But, you know, Jenna has no idea what I'm talking about.
不过，你知道，珍娜根本不知道我在说什么。

560
00:25:27.560 --> 00:25:30.500
I will admit that I don't understand a lot of what you said.
我承认，你刚才说的很多内容我都没听懂。

561
00:25:32.380 --> 00:25:34.240
However, I have an announcement.
不过，我有个消息要宣布。

562
00:25:36.160 --> 00:25:38.240
Sam, you might want to come in here for this.
萨姆，你可能得进来听一下。

563
00:25:38.440 --> 00:25:38.880
What?
什么？

564
00:25:39.040 --> 00:25:40.260
Does Sam know about it?
萨姆知道这件事吗？

565
00:25:40.360 --> 00:25:40.700
No.
不知道。

566
00:25:41.380 --> 00:25:43.400
You're bringing Sam in from the booth?
你要把萨姆从导播间叫进来？

567
00:25:43.760 --> 00:25:45.680
I'm bringing Sam in from the booth.
我要把萨姆从导播间叫进来。

568
00:25:46.140 --> 00:25:47.700
Did you meet Mark Hamill?
你见到马克·哈米尔了吗？

569
00:25:48.400 --> 00:25:48.840
What?
什么？

570
00:25:48.840 --> 00:25:53.390
Oh, Luke Skywalker.
哦，卢克·天行者。

571
00:25:53.970 --> 00:26:00.170
I know who Luke Skywalker is because this lady watched Star Wars.
我知道卢克·天行者是谁，因为这位女士看了《星球大战》。

572
00:26:04.930 --> 00:26:08.870
So, you know, with my broken shoulder, I have to ice several times a day.
所以，你知道，因为肩膀骨折，我每天得冰敷好几次。

573
00:26:09.030 --> 00:26:09.210
Yeah.
是啊。

574
00:26:09.210 --> 00:26:16.370
So, this week, while I was icing my shoulder, I watched all of Star Wars from beginning to
所以这周，我在冰敷肩膀的时候，把《星球大战》从头到尾看了一遍，

575
00:26:16.370 --> 00:26:19.010
end without falling asleep once in 30-minute increments.
每次看30分钟，一次都没睡着。

576
00:26:19.150 --> 00:26:20.850
You watched all the movies?
你把所有电影都看了？

577
00:26:20.850 --> 00:26:22.270
Did you say all of all the movies?
你是说所有的电影都看了吗？

578
00:26:22.370 --> 00:26:22.910
My God, no.
天哪，没有。

579
00:26:24.530 --> 00:26:25.710
Okay, so Jenna, Julia.
好吧，珍娜，朱莉娅。

580
00:26:25.730 --> 00:26:29.190
I watched Star Wars colon A New Hope.
我看了《星球大战：新希望》。

581
00:26:29.350 --> 00:26:29.710
Okay.
好的。

582
00:26:29.790 --> 00:26:33.730
Which I want you to know was very confusing for me as I was scrolling through all of them.
我想让你知道，我在浏览列表时被搞糊涂了。

583
00:26:34.090 --> 00:26:35.370
Well, I have questions.
好吧，我有问题要问。

584
00:26:35.510 --> 00:26:35.830
Okay.
好的。

585
00:26:36.370 --> 00:26:38.810
I have questions, but I watched the whole thing.
我有问题，但我确实把它看完了。

586
00:26:38.950 --> 00:26:39.170
Okay.
好的。

587
00:26:39.570 --> 00:26:41.210
And I'll say this.
我要说的是。

588
00:26:41.290 --> 00:26:41.730
Okay.
好的。

589
00:26:41.950 --> 00:26:46.210
Because I have questions, but I want you to know, I liked it.
因为我有问题，但我得让你知道，我挺喜欢的。

590
00:26:49.810 --> 00:26:50.290
What?
什么？

591
00:26:50.710 --> 00:26:50.950
Good.
太好了。

592
00:26:52.850 --> 00:27:01.380
How many years have you been on this planet and you have stayed in Star Wars for years?
你在地球上活了这么多年，居然这么多年都没看过《星球大战》？

593
00:27:01.760 --> 00:27:04.460
Oh, God.
哦，天哪。

594
00:27:04.600 --> 00:27:06.060
I really liked it.
我真的很喜欢。

595
00:27:06.400 --> 00:27:09.000
So much so that I have started Empire Strikes Back.
喜欢到我已经开始看《帝国反击战》了。

596
00:27:11.440 --> 00:27:13.060
Which is so good.
那部电影太棒了。

597
00:27:13.500 --> 00:27:13.940
Okay.
好的。

598
00:27:14.220 --> 00:27:14.660
So.
所以。

599
00:27:14.800 --> 00:27:15.600
So what are your questions?
那么你有什么问题？

600
00:27:15.720 --> 00:27:16.660
Here are my questions.
我的问题如下。

601
00:27:16.800 --> 00:27:18.000
I cannot believe she said she liked it.
我真不敢相信她说她喜欢。

602
00:27:18.180 --> 00:27:18.230
First of all.
首先。

603
00:27:18.440 --> 00:27:18.660
I don't.
我不信。

604
00:27:18.680 --> 00:27:20.280
I don't believe that she liked it.
我不相信她会喜欢。

605
00:27:20.280 --> 00:27:20.640
I can't.
我做不到。

606
00:27:20.900 --> 00:27:21.560
First of all.
首先。

607
00:27:21.560 --> 00:27:22.280
You're not just saying it.
你不是随口说说而已吧。

608
00:27:22.280 --> 00:27:23.000
I don't believe it.
我不相信。

609
00:27:23.100 --> 00:27:24.800
I want to say something in my defense.
我想为自己辩解几句。

610
00:27:25.040 --> 00:27:31.520
So the first 23 minutes of the movie, because I looked, has no human protagoniSt.
电影的前23分钟，因为我特意看了，根本没有人类主角。

611
00:27:31.520 --> 00:27:35.460
You meet Princess Leia for a hot second.
莱娅公主只露面了一小会儿。

612
00:27:35.620 --> 00:27:35.760
Right.
没错。

613
00:27:36.060 --> 00:27:45.320
And then everybody is in a costume that covers their face or they're a robot or they're an R2 and they're in the sand.
然后每个人都穿着遮住脸的戏服，要么就是机器人，或者是R2，他们都在沙子里。

614
00:27:46.200 --> 00:27:46.260
Yeah.
是啊。

615
00:27:46.260 --> 00:27:52.400
And it's like, it takes a long time to meet Luke Skywalker.
感觉过了好久才见到卢克·天行者。

616
00:27:52.780 --> 00:27:53.340
It takes a while.
确实花了不少时间。

617
00:27:53.720 --> 00:27:55.500
So I will say this.
所以我得说。

618
00:27:55.700 --> 00:27:58.220
I was attached to R2-D2 immediately.
我立刻就被R2-D2吸引了。

619
00:27:58.700 --> 00:28:05.300
Like when they were going to maybe not buy him when they bought C-3PO, my heart was racing.
就像他们买下C-3PO时差点没买它，当时我的心都提到嗓子眼了。

620
00:28:05.300 --> 00:28:07.300
I was like, don't leave him behind.
我当时想，别把它丢下。

621
00:28:07.540 --> 00:28:07.900
I know.
我懂。

622
00:28:08.040 --> 00:28:08.860
He's very cute.
它非常可爱。

623
00:28:08.860 --> 00:28:14.920
So I was able to hook in, but in my childhood, I never made it to Luke Skywalker.
所以我能看进去，但小时候我从来没坚持看到卢克·天行者出场。

624
00:28:15.260 --> 00:28:16.620
You never made it 23 minutes?
你连23分钟都没坚持住？

625
00:28:16.640 --> 00:28:18.080
I didn't make it 23 minutes.
我没坚持到23分钟。

626
00:28:18.300 --> 00:28:19.100
Too many robots.
机器人太多了。

627
00:28:19.220 --> 00:28:19.380
Yeah.
是啊。

628
00:28:19.500 --> 00:28:24.360
Because I remember I had memories of the sand and all of that.
因为我记得我有关于沙子之类的记忆。

629
00:28:24.460 --> 00:28:28.220
And then I had no memories until the trash compactor.
然后直到垃圾压缩机那段之前，我什么都不记得了。

630
00:28:28.300 --> 00:28:32.020
I think I woke up because I remembered from the trash compactor to the end.
我想我是那时候醒过来的，因为我记得从垃圾压缩机到结尾的内容。

631
00:28:32.240 --> 00:28:32.500
Okay.
好吧。

632
00:28:32.720 --> 00:28:34.340
The middle part is great.
中间那部分很棒。

633
00:28:35.000 --> 00:28:35.820
The movie?
电影吗？

634
00:28:36.080 --> 00:28:36.340
Yeah.
对。

635
00:28:37.760 --> 00:28:39.840
But here are a few of my questions.
但我有几个问题。

636
00:28:40.020 --> 00:28:40.320
Okay.
好。

637
00:28:40.680 --> 00:28:46.820
I don't understand Darth Vader's position in the hierarchy.
我不明白达斯·维达在等级制度里的地位。

638
00:28:47.120 --> 00:28:47.700
In the hierarchy.
在等级制度里。

639
00:28:47.840 --> 00:28:50.980
Because there seems to be a different guy that's in charge.
因为看起来还有另一个负责的人。

640
00:28:51.460 --> 00:28:53.800
And I don't understand who the ruler is.
我不明白谁才是统治者。

641
00:28:53.960 --> 00:28:54.380
Or the general.
或者是将军。

642
00:28:54.720 --> 00:28:56.340
The guy who's calling all this.
那个发号施令的人。

643
00:28:56.440 --> 00:28:58.260
The one who blows up the planet.
那个炸毁星球的人。

644
00:28:58.580 --> 00:28:58.760
Yeah.
是啊。

645
00:28:58.980 --> 00:28:59.340
Yeah.
没错。

646
00:29:00.760 --> 00:29:01.560
I know.
我知道。

647
00:29:01.680 --> 00:29:01.840
Yeah.
是啊。

648
00:29:02.180 --> 00:29:02.540
I know.
我知道。

649
00:29:02.700 --> 00:29:02.980
Spoiler.
剧透一下。

650
00:29:02.980 --> 00:29:04.640
That's the Death Star, lady.
那是死星，女士。

