1493
01:01:39.180 --> 01:01:39.540
Okay.
好的。

1494
01:01:39.860 --> 01:01:41.140
Can I have a little bit of the fluffernutter?
我能吃一点棉花糖花生酱三明治吗？

1495
01:01:41.600 --> 01:01:42.040
Yeah.
