1501
01:01:49.420 --> 01:01:51.660
This is clearly my year of doing things for the first time.
今年显然是我尝试各种第一次的一年。

1502
01:01:51.780 --> 01:01:52.660
That is so good.
那太棒了。

1503
01:01:52.940 --> 01:01:53.120
Okay.
好的。

