01:02:39.280 --> 01:02:40.720
I'm a sucker for packaging.
我就是抵挡不住包装的诱惑。

1534
01:02:41.880 --> 01:02:42.420
Carrie M.
嘉莉·M。

1535
01:02:42.680 --> 01:02:46.280
did say, maybe don't drink that beer because it might be really old.
确实说过，也许别喝那瓶啤酒，因为它可能放了很久了。

1536
01:02:46.580 --> 01:02:48.320
Carrie had a hard time finding our address.
嘉莉费了好大劲才找到我们的地址。

1537
01:02:50.900 --> 01:02:53.920
So, oh, no, you are not going to drink it.
所以，噢，不，你可不能喝它。

1538
01:02:55.580 --> 01:02:57.540
I was that person in college, guys.
伙计们，我大学时就是那种人。

1539
01:03:03.250 --> 01:03:04.090
It's stout.
这是世涛啤酒。

1540
01:03:04.350 --> 01:03:05.470
I don't hate it, though.
不过我不讨厌它。

1541
01:03:05.910 --> 01:03:06.130
Okay.
好的。

1542
01:03:06.230 --> 01:03:07.350
Well, here's Sunny Cat Beer.
好吧，这是“阳光猫”啤酒。

1543
01:03:07.670 --> 01:03:08.890
Do you want to try Sunny Cat Beer?
你想尝尝“阳光猫”啤酒吗？

1544
01:03:09.990 --> 01:03:10.470
Okay.
好的。

1545
01:03:10.470 --> 01:03:11.430
It's real foamy.
泡沫真多。

1546
01:03:11.650 --> 01:03:12.350
It's real foamy.
泡沫真多。

1547
01:03:12.910 --> 01:03:13.310
Oh.
噢。

1548
01:03:14.650 --> 01:03:17.290
What's the thing where you do the grease off your nose and put it on the foam?
就是那种用鼻子上的油蹭一下抹在泡沫上的那个东西叫什么来着？

1549
01:03:17.370 --> 01:03:18.450
Have you guys ever heard about that?
你们听说过那个吗？

1550
01:03:19.990 --> 01:03:21.490
I'm showing my true colors.
我真是原形毕露了。

1551
01:03:26.670 --> 01:03:28.050
Reminds me of, like, a Guinness.
让我想起了健力士啤酒。

1552
01:03:28.530 --> 01:03:32.400
I don't mind Cafe Disco.
我不介意咖啡迪斯科。

1553
01:03:33.040 --> 01:03:34.240
I think it's turned.
我觉得它变质了。

1554
01:03:35.260 --> 01:03:36.380
No, it hasn't turned.
不，它没变质。

1555
01:03:37.680 --> 01:03:38.480
That's tangy.
那是种酸味。

1556
01:03:39.760 --> 01:03:41.040
I don't mind Sunny Cat.
我不介意阳光猫啤酒。

1557
01:03:41.380 --> 01:03:42.300
You'll like it better.
你会更喜欢这个的。

1558
01:03:43.240 --> 01:03:45.220
This just tastes like a Guinness.
