Mary Telly, the founder and CEO of the Electric City Roasting Company, sent all of us bags of boom-roasted coffee.
“电力城烘焙公司”的创始人和首席执行官玛丽·泰利，给我们每人都寄来了几袋“砰砰烘焙”咖啡。

