1571
01:04:20.300 --> 01:04:31.000
It all started when I was deep diving Andy's mug from the seminar, and then that led me to the Zumo's Cafe, which then led me to the Electric City Roasting Company.
这一切始于我深入调查安迪在研讨会上的马克杯，然后那引导我找到了祖莫咖啡馆，接着又引导我找到了电力城烘焙公司。

1572
01:04:31.460 --> 01:04:35.600
I got a letter from Anna S., who heard that episode, who lives in Scranton.
我收到了一封来自安娜·S的信，她听了那一集，她住在斯克兰顿。

1573
01:04:36.020 --> 01:04:37.860
Anna went to Zumo's Cafe.
安娜去了祖莫咖啡馆。

1574
01:04:38.200 --> 01:04:40.160
Anna sent us both mugs from Zumo's.
安娜给我们俩都寄来了祖莫的马克杯。

1575
01:04:40.820 --> 01:04:41.860
Oh, I love it.
哦，我太喜欢了。

1576
01:04:41.980 --> 01:04:42.480
I know.
我知道。

1577
01:04:43.100 --> 01:04:44.220
We heart Scranton.
