感谢你们寄来的信件。

1589
01:05:31.470 --> 01:05:36.470
Thank you to the entire staff who put together this live recording.
感谢所有促成这次现场录制的全体工作人员。

1590
01:05:36.490 --> 01:05:37.710
Yeah, of our podcaSt.
