And just thank you guys so much for being here today.
真的非常感谢大家今天能来到这里。

1593
01:05:44.650 --> 01:05:49.390
We know you traveled from far places and you made a trip out of it, and it just means so much to us.
我们知道你们从很远的地方赶来，特意跑了这一趟，这对我们意义重大。

